# OZONE world – KryoArchipel_Severny (Hydrosis Prime / Dusk Falls)
# Dusk-lit cascade terraces: three levels stepping 16 -> 8 -> 0, two waterfalls,
# a ruined aqueduct over the upper fall, stepping stones through the basin and a
# lookout exit. Format: ozone v1.0
# Hierarchy: Hydrosis Prime -> Sefirah 2 -> KryoArchipel_Severny
#
# All-brush terrain: collision is AABB-only, so terraces are brushes. Every
# walkable rise is 0.9 or less (kStepHeight is exactly 1.0).
# Box arg order is  x y z  w h d  rot  where h is the VERTICAL size (Z).
#
# UV NOTE: BuildBox multiplies generated UVs by 16 (h >= 1.0) or 8 (thin), so an
# authored texScale is a MULTIPLIER on top. Keep values near 1.
#
# SHELVES: each terrace has one 0.9-high shelf. 0.9 is walkable without a step,
# which is why the relief is a shelf and not a staircase.
#
# POOLS: both receiving pools sit UNDER their cascade (x -29..-3 at the foot of
# cascade 1, x 31..57 under cascade 2). They used to start 10-18 units east of
# the falls, which left the water landing on dry stone.
#
# Zone names are the lookup keys for the sibling .ozls defs in this directory.

# --- Three terraces (y -56..46; the north strip y 46..58 carries the stairs) ---
add box -60 -5 7 60 18 102 0 texPath=GameData/Worlds/World_endless_snow/oztex/tileset/02_floor_snow_a3_32.png texScaleU=1 texScaleV=1
add box 0 -5 3 60 10 102 0 texPath=GameData/Worlds/World_endless_snow/oztex/tileset/04_floor_snow_a5_32.png texScaleU=1 texScaleV=1
add box 60 -5 -1 60 2 102 0 texPath=GameData/Worlds/World_endless_snow/oztex/tileset/03_floor_snow_a4_32.png texScaleU=1 texScaleV=1

# --- 0.9 shelves: west third of T1, south aprons on T2 and T3 ---
add box -74 -5 16.45 32 0.9 102 0 texPath=GameData/Worlds/World_endless_snow/oztex/tileset/03_floor_snow_a4_32.png texScaleU=1 texScaleV=1
add box -10 -43 8.45 40 0.9 26 0 texPath=GameData/Worlds/World_endless_snow/oztex/tileset/02_floor_snow_a3_32.png texScaleU=1 texScaleV=1
add box 50 -43 0.45 40 0.9 26 0 texPath=GameData/Worlds/World_endless_snow/oztex/tileset/04_floor_snow_a5_32.png texScaleU=1 texScaleV=1

# --- North strip: a floor at each terrace level so the stairs never open onto void ---
add box -60 52 7.5 60 17 12 0 texPath=GameData/Worlds/World_endless_snow/oztex/tileset/02_floor_snow_a3_32.png texScaleU=1 texScaleV=1
add box 0 52 3.5 60 9 12 0 texPath=GameData/Worlds/World_endless_snow/oztex/tileset/04_floor_snow_a5_32.png texScaleU=1 texScaleV=1
add box 60 52 -0.5 60 1 12 0 texPath=GameData/Worlds/World_endless_snow/oztex/tileset/03_floor_snow_a4_32.png texScaleU=1 texScaleV=1

