ParticleEmitter fire 64 -16 0.9 26 0.8 2.6 10 0.35 0.05 255 175 70 255 60 0 -2 5 0 0 1 0
ParticleEmitter fire 64 16 0.9 26 0.8 2.6 10 0.35 0.05 255 175 70 255 60 0 -2 5 0 0 1 0
